    <question_explanation no="9" id="PRB-30EF26B7EF888569-Q9">
      <question_stem>다음 $RLC$ 병렬공진회로의 전달함수 $H ( \omega ) = \frac{V {( \omega )}}{I {( \omega )}}$는? (단, ω는 각주파수이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>병렬공진회로</keyword>
        <keyword>전달함수</keyword>
        <keyword>각주파수이다</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$H ( \omega ) = \frac{R}{1 + jR \sqrt{\frac{C}{L}} \left( \omega \sqrt{LC} - \frac{1}{omegasqrt {LC}} \right)}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전자공학개론 · RLC 병렬회로의 전달함수
정답은 ③이다. 병렬회로의 어드미턴스는 Y = 1/R + jωC + 1/(jωL) = 1/R + j(ωC − 1/(ωL))이므로 H = V/I = R/[1 + jR(ωC − 1/(ωL))]이다. ωC − 1/(ωL) = √(C/L)[ω√(LC) − 1/(ω√(LC))]로 정리하면 ③과 같다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$H ( \omega ) = \frac{R}{1 + jR \sqrt{\frac{L}{C}} \left( \frac{\omega}{\sqrt{LC}} - \frac{\sqrt{LC}}{\omega} \right)}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계수와 괄호 안의 식이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$H ( \omega ) = \frac{R}{1 + jR \sqrt{\frac{C}{L}} \left( \frac{\omega}{\sqrt{LC}} - \frac{\sqrt{LC}}{\omega} \right)}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>괄호 안의 식이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$H ( \omega ) = \frac{R}{1 + jR \sqrt{\frac{C}{L}} \left( \omega \sqrt{LC} - \frac{1}{omegasqrt {LC}} \right)}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$H ( \omega ) = \frac{R}{1 + jR \sqrt{\frac{L}{C}} \left( \omega \sqrt{LC} - \frac{1}{\omega \sqrt{LC}} \right)}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>√(C/L) 대신 √(L/C)를 썼다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
